title: "Environment Snapshots in Mårran: Taming Mutation under Non-Strict Evaluation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Liddell"
    given-names: "Alice Eve"
    alias: "Fancryer"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-1304-0984"
